# Redirects applied by the Cloudflare Workers static-asset server.
#
# Astro copies public/ into dist/ verbatim, and Workers Static Assets reads
# _redirects from the root of the assets directory. Format is
# `[from] [to] [status]`; only 301, 302, 303, 307 and 308 are accepted.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# /mcp — THIS ONE IS LOAD-BEARING. DO NOT TURN IT INTO A PAGE.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The apex answers /mcp with a 308 to mcp.mzizi.dev/mcp today, and agents follow
# that documented address. It is the one path on this site that must stay a
# redirect rather than become a page: an MCP client that lands on HTML instead
# of being sent to the server does not degrade, it fails.
#
# 308, not 301 or 302: a permanent redirect that preserves the request method
# and body. MCP's streamable-HTTP transport POSTs JSON-RPC, and a 301/302 lets
# a client rewrite that POST to a GET — which looks like a working redirect and
# silently drops the request. This is the same status the apex returns now, and
# it must stay the same through the cutover.
/mcp https://mcp.mzizi.dev/mcp 308

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The registry API lives on api.mzizi.dev (mzizi-api-gateway). Old links to the
# apex's /api/v1 go there, method preserved.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/api/v1 https://api.mzizi.dev/v1 308
/api/v1/* https://api.mzizi.dev/v1/:splat 308

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Registry portal pages that are not ported to this site yet. The registry app
# still serves them, so send visitors there instead of a 404. 302, not 301: each
# one comes back here as it is ported, and a cached permanent redirect would
# outlive that. Remove a line when its page lands in src/pages/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/playground https://mzizi-registry.nyuchi.workers.dev/playground 302
/playground/* https://mzizi-registry.nyuchi.workers.dev/playground/:splat 302
/skills https://mzizi-registry.nyuchi.workers.dev/skills 302
/skills/* https://mzizi-registry.nyuchi.workers.dev/skills/:splat 302
/cli https://mzizi-registry.nyuchi.workers.dev/cli 302
/observability https://mzizi-registry.nyuchi.workers.dev/observability 302
/components/* https://mzizi-registry.nyuchi.workers.dev/components/:splat 302
